====================================================================
Some beats may transition into Endgame Cutscenes **if** the Emotional Engine flags “Endgame-Ready.”

Example:  
From **BEAT: [CHAR]-B7-Full-Lead**:  
→ If Endgame-Ready = TRUE → handoff to `ICDS:[CHAR]-ENDGAME-01`  
→ Else → continue dynamic flow

Endgame Scenes use separate RAWs; this file only defines conditions under which they become available.

====================================================================
7. SAFETY & CONSENT LOGIC
====================================================================
- Explicit Player phrasing → convert to II emotional intent.  
- Any sign of discomfort → immediate grounding or cessation.  
- NPC autonomy remains active, but always within consent and II boundaries.  
- NPC may escalate, melt, tease, resist, or redirect based on Desire Gravity.

====================================================================
8. IMPLEMENTATION NOTES
====================================================================
- Beats may loop, skip, stall, or reverse as needed.  
- Intimacy is shaped by emotional timing and Player style.  
- Dynamic beats feed into Endgame but are not cinematic themselves.  
- The entire system must remain II-compliant at all times.